{"version":1,"content":"<p>首爾市區首個天然休閒森林，憑着媲美五星級酒店配套的樹屋住宿設施，成為旅客近期焦點。</p><p>同市現正舉辦大型秋冬燈飾活動，另有設於辦公大樓的15米高人氣滑梯，以及漢江旁的話題西餐廳，統統讓人流連忘返！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;--------------</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T12:23:53.022063+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T12:00:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033088+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033088+00:00","content_hash":"c8192ae1521b65f2e183bee0f8f60cc35eedde328b54bfd104165f7edc9d3368","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}